   "titulo": "Country and nationality",
   "texto": [
    "**你是哪个国家的人？** asks «What country are you from?». In Chinese there is no different termination for «Spanish» and «Spanish»: **西班牙人** for both. **美国人** means «American» and **英国人**, «British»."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Speak languages",
   "texto": [
    "**说** means «talk.». **中文** and **汉语** are two common ways of saying «Chinese» as a language; **英语** is «English» and **西班牙语**, «Spanish». In Spanish we often add «the» in front of the language; in Chinese no article is put."
   ]
  },
